{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 82285, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 57327, "uid": 95587, "type": 4, "title": "萌新每日必做", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1625544604, "updated_at": 1628685158, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1628685158, "last_at": 1688645403, "comment_count": 9, "status": 1, "summary": "更新日志Hi，我是黑尾。庞大的DC系统会让初心者及回归玩家不知所措，本人算是公测后AKF几年的萌老回归玩家，对于每天该做什么，如何最大化获得水晶（氪金货币）苦恼了好一阵。所以决定通过这篇攻略来分享和梳", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625885179305_59034884.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625543561737_95648599.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625542350417_47312861.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 48, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 62109, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 41, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 82285, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">更新日志</span></p></div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><br><br><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\">Hi，我是黑尾。</span><br style=\"\">庞大的DC系统会让初心者及回归玩家不知所措，<br style=\"\">本人算是公测后AKF几年的萌老回归玩家，对于每天该做什么，如何最大化获得水晶（<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">氪金货币</span>）苦恼了好一阵。</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">所以决定通过这篇攻略来分享和梳理下关于“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">丽莎的每日任务、PVE、PVE、地下铁、皮肤塔、温泉等等</span>”的流程，</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">便于新人向玩家完成日常，快速获取水晶。</div></span><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\">注：韩服每天北京时间凌晨3点更新</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line1\" style=\"margin:5px0px;height:20px;width:811.797px;font-size:20px;\"></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(75,82,91);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">发送友情点数&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><p></p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>打开游戏第一件事：点开社区，发送好友币，养成良好的习惯，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">受益</span>他人、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">方便</span>自己。</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>好友会在邮件内收到根据友情值。<br style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>相对应的友情点，好友币可以通过【<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">召唤</span>】里的扭蛋机<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">功能</span>抽水晶、体力、玛瑙等货币。<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></span></div><div style=\"\">（新人入坑可以根据“邀请好友”按照&lt;最后上线时间&gt;来尝试加一些好友，能否被大佬回复要看命了）</div></span><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span><i class=\"dialog-mark-icon\"></i><span><i class=\"dialog-mark-icon\"></i><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625884738121_31154875.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625884738121_31154875.jpg\"></span></span></div><br></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(75,82,91);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(51,51,51);\">丽莎的作业<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></span></p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>丽莎的每日只要完成&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">8个&nbsp;</span>就可以获得<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(49,133,155);font-weight:bold;\">400额外水晶</span>，正常全部完成可以获得总计<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(49,133,155);\">1000水晶&nbsp;</span>，</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">·&nbsp;</span>2021-7-1更新的铁匠日常目前不知是否为常态作业日常，如果算上，丽莎总计可以获得1050水晶。</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">个人推荐作业完成顺序如下：</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></span><br style=\"\"></div></span><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625536746363_55788027.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625536746363_55788027.jpg\" style=\"\"></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;\">一. 夜市街（夜世界）完成材料、金币、进化副本</span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>新版本开启了铁匠分解高级材料的功能，所以目前版本按照队伍强队，打最高的材料副本就可以了。<span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>金币副本萌新注意不要用异常刀攻略，选择NS重攻击高的刀或控来打FeverTime攻击，</span></span>由于5级boss不吃所有异常状态，所以非常硬。</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>经验副本出的史莱姆EXP狗粮，个人不建议用来升级天子，升级可以通过“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><a href=\"http://destinychild.gamekee.com/81793.html\">挖矿</a></span>”来刷PVE剧情本。</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>EXP狗粮直接拆玛瑙更为划算。<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625536930170_73263580.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625536930170_73263580.jpg\" style=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">二. 探索、PVP 3场</span><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>探索特别前期可以只升级主要队伍，12小时一次1200点经验。中期可以挂3星狗粮，挂满30级可邮件获得30水晶一人。后期可以挂4星“胎5”的进化食物。我们这里可以先<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">选择1小时</span>，一会完成其他任务后可以回来收一波菜。</span><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625537226839_23629362.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625537226839_23629362.jpg\" style=\"\"></div><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div></span></div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">PVP只打3场就可以去干别的了，让他先回复冷却的时间，完成丽莎的日常后再回来进行5、10、20次的胜利任务，以及Unknown任务。</span><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>另外，像我这种萌新打不进太高的排名，可以换一个必输的队伍认输降分，降到一定等级后，就可以挂机再打上来，这样能够确保胜利几率。毕竟<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">PVP每日全部完成奖励水晶也有好几百。</span></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625537572274_18774499.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625537572274_18774499.jpg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">三. 升级天子技能、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">提炼玛瑙<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">、</span></span>强化武器或歌牌等级</span><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">打开Child天子界面，选择一个需要升级的“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">老婆</span>”，点击右下角<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">“技能”</span></span>，随便升1级。</span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>由于自动攻击很鸡肋，前期伤害基本可以无视，我个人的方法是，每天升1级混日常。<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></span></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625539533471_24221785.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625539533471_24221785.jpg\" style=\"\"></div></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">打开提炼玛瑙选项<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:700;\">“觉醒”，分解EXP狗粮。</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>tips：如果找不到要拆的狗粮，天子不是在探索、就是在队伍、乱斗里，还有身上有锁或<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">装备道</span></span>具。</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625540133588_1212598.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625540133588_1212598.jpg\" style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\">打开物品选项，点击“查看装备物品”后，选择需要培养的歌牌进行强化升级。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>个人不推荐前中期对武器进行过多升级，可以查看Wiki的</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,176,240);\">装备节奏榜&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">来查看哪些武器值得培养。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>因为歌牌目前只能利用狗粮武器装备来升级，所以尽量优先稀有歌牌来喂。武器可通过活动道具强化。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625540938817_65259366.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625540938817_65259366.jpg\" style=\"\"></div></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">四. 10次剧情PVE副本</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">10次剧情本相对比较费时，前期萌新可以选择 1-4-6 的Exp加成本刷狗粮经验，中后期可以选择 4-5-1 来1拖4</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">每天北京时间6点-8点 两个小时为经验双倍，也可以保留这个日常在晚上进行挂机来完成。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625541646012_28445438.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625541646012_28445438.jpg\" style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div>五. 地下迷宫（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">地铁</span>）</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">地下铁是武器狗粮的获取渠道，根据不同星级和通关来解锁更高等级。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">由于副本中过图阵亡的角色无法复活，所以如果练度不高，个人建议挂机的话，DS大招尽量只留给能复活的奶妈，或1奶1刀循环。</span><br style=\"\"></span>&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625542859116_68895069.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625542859116_68895069.jpg\" style=\"\"></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">六. 消费水晶与其他</span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">丽莎的作业做的差不多了，辛苦啦！&nbsp;</span></div></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">此时差不多也完成了1小时的探索了，回去收获一下，然后设置12小时挂机就可以了。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">最后一项消费水晶，可以去召唤抽一发5%的2700. 也可以通过商店消费27水晶购换3000金币。这样里外里赚23水晶</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">·<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">韩服玩家强烈不建议，上头抽其余0.9%池子</span></span>，钻石用在其他地方收益大，</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">· 联动限定池子可酌情抽</span><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625542248984_24240839.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625542248984_24240839.jpg\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625542350417_47312861.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625542350417_47312861.jpg\" style=\"\"></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(75,82,91);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">PVP 及 皮肤塔、温泉等</span></p></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\">完成了丽莎的作业后，可以折返回来继续完成刚才没打完的pvp日常。</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">随后进行皮肤塔和温泉的日常活动。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">·</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">Tips: 个人推荐萌新前期在皮肤塔只完成1次 1-3和 3-1 4次，这样可以完成除5层每日外的其他所有任务。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">水晶获取最大化，比起翻车要来的划算。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625543268597_24286826.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625543268597_24286826.jpg\" style=\"\"></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><div style=\"\">OK，以上就是每天的日常流程，希望对新入坑和回归的老玩家带来些许帮助。</div><div style=\"\">众人拾柴火焰高，希望大家多多指教，不足之处请留言或评论，下次见咯。</div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625543561737_95648599.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625543561737_95648599.png\" style=\"height:139.109px;width:223.18px;\"><br style=\"\">2021-7-6</div></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\">", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625885179305_59034884.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625543561737_95648599.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625542350417_47312861.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 95587, "username": "黑尾君", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/25.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 12, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 4, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 4, "read_num": 65389, "like_num": 48}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description":